sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Owner as L&D Baseline or Expert Skill owner
  participant UI as Scoped policy UI
  participant Service as ScopedAssessmentPolicyService
  participant Catalog as Neo4j policy catalog and Question Bank
  participant PG as PostgreSQL scoped policy store
  Owner->>UI: Choose Role-Level or Skill-knowledge scope
  UI->>Service: Read directory and current scope
  Service->>Catalog: Resolve owned catalog and bank capacity
  Service-->>UI: Draft, active pointer and scoped history
  Owner->>Service: Create or save draft with expected revision
  Service->>PG: Authorize, coordinate org-purpose and retain receipt
  Service->>PG: Save mutable configuration and catalog hash
  Owner->>Service: Publish expected draft and activation revision
  Service->>Catalog: Revalidate exact scope, groups and bank readiness
  Service->>PG: Immutable scoped version, active pointer and consume draft
  Service-->>UI: Retained authorized outcome
  Note over Owner,Service: Expert role enforced, individual Skill assignment filtering remains incomplete
